      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "Intro text",
      "default": "Ordering a shipping container from Used Conex is simple, fast, and secure. Whether you're storing tools, inventory, or household goods, our 3-step process ensures a smooth experience from quote to delivery."
